  MKR1010 + Arduino IoT Cloud + WiFiNINA (explicit)
  - Uses secrets/connection from thingProperties.h
  - Prints WiFiNINA firmware and WiFi status
  - Updates Cloud var `temp` with a test waveform so you can see data in the dashboard
